ion":"Well Perforation data is not available for all wells in this dataset. Well perforations are screened intervals (openings) allowing groundwater to enter well casing. Wells can have multiple screen intervals, up to 10 screened intervals can be recorded for each well in this dataset.","format":"CSV","hash":"dde1fd6eaa063adb8b3aa0b40b8bd624","id":"b5890ff4-930e-4c8c-8247-b2ca24bf453a","last_modified":null,"metadata_modified":"2026-10-08T18:33:14.408171","mimetype":null,"mimetype_inner":null,"name":"Well Perforations","package_id":"e5141a07-e269-4580-8b2c-54c7ac08442a","position":2,"resource_type":null,"size":null,"state":"active","url":"https://data.cnra.ca.gov/dataset/dd9b15f5-6d08-4d8c-bace-37dc761a9c08/resource/f1deaa6d-2cb5-4052-a73f-08a69f26b750/download/perforations.csv","url_type":null},{"cache_last_updated":null,"cache_url":null,"created":"2026-09-30T19:04:07.052883","datastore_active":false,"description":"Zip file containing all resources from Periodic Groundwater Level Measurements dataset.","format":"ZIP","hash":"","id":"0017632e-4b0f-41bd-b953-2e77d4a10c35","last_modified":null,"metadata_modified":"2026-09-30T19:04:07.014847","mimetype":null,"mimetype_inner":null,"name":"Bulk Data Download","package_id":"e5141a07-e269-4580-8b2c-54c7ac08442a","position":3,"resource_type":null,"size":null,"state":"active","url":"https://data.cnra.ca.gov/dataset/dd9b15f5-6d08-4d8c-bace-37dc761a9c08/resource/c51e0af9-5980-4aa3-8965-e9ea494ad468/download/periodic_gwl_bulkdatadownload.zip","url_type":null},{"cache_last_updated":null,"cache_url":null,"created":"2026-09-30T19:04:07.052884","datastore_active":false,"description":"Text file containing a record of schema changes made to any of the resources.","format":"TXT","hash":"","id":"c1eff72e-a93f-498a-a54c-20ad9db63e7d","last_modified":null,"metadata_modified":"2026-09-30T19:04:07.016828","mimetype":null,"mimetype_inner":null,"name":"Change Log","package_id":"e5141a07-e269-4580-8b2c-54c7ac08442a","position":4,"resource_type":null,"size":null,"state":"active","url":"https://data.cnra.ca.gov/dataset/dd9b15f5-6d08-4d8c-bace-37dc761a9c08/resource/2a580984-1738-43dd-b03c-6f9ab929d11d/download/changelog-2.txt","url_type":null},{"cache_last_updated":null,"cache_url":null,"created":"2026-09-30T19:04:07.052884","datastore_active":false,"description":"Links to spatial data resources for the groundwater elevation monitoring stations (wells) maintained in the California Department of Water Resources’ (hereafter the Department) Enterprise Water Management database. Individual station information comes from a wide variety of sources, including and local and federal agencies, that conduct groundwater elevation monitoring within the state of California.","format":"","hash":"","id":"ca0a4782-04d8-4e28-9ec4-73f5353db889","last_modified":null,"metadata_modified":"2026-09-30T19:04:07.018815","mimetype":null,"mimetype_inner":null,"name":"Link to spatial data resources","package_id":"e5141a07-e269-4580-8b2c-54c7ac08442a","position":5,"resource_type":null,"size":null,"state":"active","url":"https://data.cnra.ca.gov/dataset/i08-groundwaterstations-enterprisewatermanagement","url_type":null},{"cache_last_updated":null,"cache_url":null,"created":"2026-09-30T19:04:07.052905","datastore_active":false,"description":"Some simple approaches to querying large csv datasets on CNRA Open data","format":"","hash":"","id":"f54f5975-5748-4793-8170-35f35ef41e46","last_modified":null,"metadata_modified":"2026-09-30T19:04:07.020759","mimetype":null,"mimetype_inner":null,"name":"Querying large csv datasets","package_id":"e5141a07-e269-4580-8b2c-54c7ac08442a","position":6,"resource_type":null,"size":null,"state":"active","url":"https://data.cnra.ca.gov/pages/querying-large-csv-datasets","url_type":null}],"tags":[{"display_name":"SGMA","id":"ec74acb6-d61e-47e2-9693-c4b6a6aae9c6","name":"SGMA","state":"active","vocabulary_id":null},{"display_name":"california","id":"b28eaa15-9663-4abb-9e11-c1877afb3ce7","name":"california","state":"active","vocabulary_id":null},{"display_name":"california department of water resources","id":"c036faaa-033b-49b1-b3aa-8299d01608c4","name":"california department of water resources","state":"active","vocabulary_id":null},{"display_name":"casgem","id":"7e8a0c7f-4a1c-459c-87f8-7a81100a1981","name":"casgem","state":"active","vocabulary_id":null},{"display_name":"groundwater","id":"ebedfdcb-0956-4937-9726-86a90420ee57","name":"groundwater","state":"active","vocabulary_id":null},{"display_name":"water data library","id":"0ff0904f-2cff-4e06-b0c3-f628d08381c8","name":"water data library","state":"active","vocabulary_id":null},{"display_name":"wdl","id":"fb4653f0-f483-4ea0-aef1-fc2119a62c1e","name":"wdl","state":"active","vocabulary_id":null},{"display_name":"wells","id":"c84941fe-f7c4-4281-8f3a-429872358a68","name":"wells","state":"active","vocabulary_id":null}],"relationships_as_subject":[],"relationships_as_object":[]},"relatedDatasets":[{"accessLevel":"public","accrualPeriodicity":"irregular","author_email":null,"conformsTo":"","contact_email":"benjamin.gooding@water.ca.gov","contact_name":"Ben Gooding","creator_user_id":"be1db721-b4f5-4257-abcb-c2115ad06ee3","id":"ec6c66de-25a2-41d5-a58e-e58259c56432","isopen":false,"language":"","license_title":null,"maintainer":null,"maintainer_email":null,"metadata_created":"2026-09-30T19:31:06.496172","metadata_modified":"2026-10-08T18:33:15.211266","name":"groundwater-sustainability-plan-annual-report-data","notes":"The Groundwater Sustainability Plan (GSP) Annual Report (AR) datasets contain the following data submitted by Groundwater Sustainability Agencies (GSA) and Alternative Agencies as part of their GSP AR or Alternative to GSP AR: groundwater extraction, surface water supply, total water use, and change in storage volumes for a given water year. All data was originally submitted to the Department of Water Resources (DWR) through the Sustainable Groundwater Management Act (SGMA) Portal’s AR Modules (https://sgma.water.ca.gov/portal/gspar/submitted and https://sgma.water.ca.gov/portal/alternative/annualreport/submitted). Data records within each dataset correspond to either an entire basin or one of multiple GSP areas which collectively correspond to an entire basin.  \r\n  \r\nThe GSP Regulations established the AR data requirements (23 CCR § 356.2) and tasked DWR with developing an online reporting system for GSAs and Alternative Agencies to electronically submit these data (23 CCR § 353.2). The data fields associated with these datasets were created by DWR to ensure GSAs and Alternative Agencies electronically submitted the required AR data to DWR’s online reporting system, the SGMA Portal (https://sgma.water.ca.gov/portal/). For additional information regarding the AR Modules and the AR submittal process, please view the DWR’s AR resources (https://sgma.water.ca.gov/portal/resources).","num_resources":6,"num_tags":5,"organization":{"id":"01a60364-64d7-4a35-98ee-ead3a26785ec","name":"california-department-of-water-resources","title":"California Department of Water Resources","type":"organization","description":"Website: https://water.ca.gov/\r\n\r\nThe Department of Water Resources (DWR) is responsible for managing and protecting California’s water resources. DWR works with other agencies to benefit the State’s people and to protect, restore and enhance the natural and human environments.","image_url":"2018-12-07-183801.609480DWRLOGO4inch.jpg","created":"2026-09-30T19:02:07.434431","is_organization":true,"approval_status":"approved","state":"active"},"owner_org":"01a60364-64d7-4a35-98ee-ead3a26785ec","private":false,"rights":"No restrictions on public use","state":"active","temporal":"","title":"Groundwater Sustainability Plan Annual Report Data","type":"dataset","version":null,"extras":[{"key":"guid","value":"05041838-896f-4d1a-beff-0fd43b5a3e0f"},{"key":"dcat_issued","value":"2020-07-06T23:41:35.820445"},{"key":"dcat_modified","value":"2026-10-08T15:00:20.966180"},{"key":"dc